
>> Size := Objè nouvo.
Size lè: ['is:'] fè: { :nimewo
	nimewo lè: ['+'] fè: { :nimewo
		>> unit := nimewo inite-mezi.
		>> factor := 1.
		
		unit
		ka: ['inch'] fè: { factor := 0.0833. }. <- tèt-li + (nimewo * factor).
	}. <- nimewo.
}.

# This size number can be used as follows:

>> plank := Size is: 6 foot.
>> edge := Size is: 50 inch.

# This will show as: 10.165
Sòti ekri: plank + edge, nouvo-liy.
